{"id":"7e3484b94f13a4f9","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-separator-pi01.md","title":"分离类有效闭且非空","display":"thm-separator-pi01 — 分离类有效闭且非空","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-separator-pi01","aliases":["43-thm-separator-pi01"],"display":"thm-separator-pi01 — 分离类有效闭且非空","depends_on":["[[43-df-separating-class]]","[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-pi01class]]","[[43-thm-effective-closed-complement]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Example 5.16.2, print p.62 / PDF p.82","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-separator-pi01"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-separator-pi01</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-separator-pi01 — 分离类有效闭且非空"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60672835251bfec4\" href=\"?note=60672835251bfec4\" title=\"43-df-separating-class\">43-df-separating-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d2a7ec8c3ff53d91\" href=\"?note=d2a7ec8c3ff53d91\" title=\"43-thm-effective-closed-complement\">43-thm-effective-closed-complement</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Example 5.16.2, print p.62 / PDF p.82"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\cap B=\\varnothing\">\\(A\\cap B=\\varnothing\\)</span>且二者c.e.。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sep}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sep}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}\">\\(\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"60672835251bfec4\" href=\"?note=60672835251bfec4\" title=\"43-df-separating-class\">43-df-separating-class</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)\\land A\\cap B=\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\operatorname{Sep}(A,B))\\land\\operatorname{Sep}(A,B)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)\\land A\\cap B=\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\operatorname{Sep}(A,B))\\land\\operatorname{Sep}(A,B)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>违反某个A位置取1或B位置取0可有效枚举成开集；取A自身的特征序列给出非空见证。</p>\n<p>来源：Example 5.16.2, print p.62 / PDF p.82。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","